@* ProjectAuditPage: the audit trail of one project for whoever may read its audit trail, at "/projects/{id}/audit".

   Presentation only; state and loading live in ProjectAuditPage.razor.cs. The entries recorded for the project
   (member changes, repositories, reviews and signatures of that project), newest first, 25, 50 or 100 per page, with
   a filter bar (actor, action, review, from and to date, page size; the state lives in the query string) and Older /
   Newer buttons that carry the position and the filter in the address. Entries of other projects and entries
   without a project are never shown here; the whole trail and the button that verifies its hash chain stay on the
   page for system administrators at "/audit". The filter bar is drawn by the shared AuditFilterForm component, the
   entries and the paging by the shared AuditEntryTable component. Who may open the page is the audit-read right of
   the project (project administrators and system administrators; Auditors once that role can be assigned). All
   text comes from the audit trail and is rendered as plain text. Every key value carries a stable kebab-case
   data-testid, and the data-interactive marker on the root flips to "true" once the live circuit is connected.

   Human factors: (a) one filter bar and one table; (b) the page is a read-only view, so the only buttons are the
   filter and paging ones; (c) an empty trail says so, and a filter that matches nothing says that instead of
   showing an empty table.

   The page body is inside SessionGate, which replaces it with a "Session ended" message when the user is no longer
   valid while the page is open. *@
@page "/projects/{ProjectId:int}/audit"
@rendermode InteractiveServer
@attribute [Authorize]

<PageTitle>Project audit trail - ReviewCenter</PageTitle>

<SessionGate>
<main class="page" data-testid="project-audit-page" data-interactive="@InteractiveMarker">
    <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/projects" data-testid="breadcrumb-projects-link">Projects</a>
        @if (Project is not null)
        {
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <a href="/projects/@ProjectId" data-testid="breadcrumb-project-link">@Project.Name</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <span aria-current="page">Audit trail</span>
        }
    </nav>

    @if (!Loaded)
    {
        <p class="muted" data-testid="project-audit-loading">Loading...</p>
    }
    else if (Project is null || Page is null)
    {
        <p class="error" role="alert" data-testid="project-not-found">Project @ProjectId does not exist.</p>
    }
    else
    {
        <h1>Audit trail</h1>
        <p class="page-lead">A tamper-evident record of what happened in this project, newest first.</p>
        <AuditFilterForm State="Filter" BasePath="@BasePath" />
        <AuditEntryTable Page="Page" BasePath="@BasePath" Filter="Filter"
                         EmptyText="Nothing has been recorded for this project yet." />
    }
</main>
</SessionGate>
